essionId":"ses_13c86374affeENJtNmpx2v5KKt","title":"Rebase Phase 13d onto origin/main"},"ses_13c853083ffezIU42rWMw05Zb6":{"concepts":["git rebase","dependency management","Stripe integration","conflict resolution"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:14:47.522Z","filesModified":["scripts/stripe-bootstrap/go.mod"],"keyDecisions":["Prioritized stripe-go v82.5.1 to satisfy project requirements for Phase 13c during rebase conflict resolution."],"narrative":"Resolved a git rebase conflict in the `scripts/stripe-bootstrap/go.mod` file by forcing the stripe-go dependency to version v82.5.1. After staging the resolution, the rebase operation was successfully completed. This action finalized the Phase 13c Stripe integration, as confirmed by the updated git status and commit history.","observationCount":15,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c853083ffezIU42rWMw05Zb6","title":"Resolve Rebase Conflict and Finalize Phase 13c Stripe Integration"},"ses_13c849f8fffeL83WJEBV7MQP6r":{"concepts":["Git rebase","Merge conflict resolution","Git hooks"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:15:22.201Z","filesModified":["scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit"],"keyDecisions":["Identified that the conflict occurred due to concurrent changes in the pre-commit script during the rebase process."],"narrative":"Investigated a merge conflict in the `scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit` file encountered during a rebase. Analyzed the current branch history against `origin/main` to understand the divergence. Prepared the environment to resolve the conflict caused by simultaneous modifications to the git hook script.","observationCount":14,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c849f8fffeL83WJEBV7MQP6r","title":"Resolve Git Rebase Conflict in pre-commit hook"},"ses_13c841b99ffe9qmfTw52X9UER9":{"concepts":["Git rebase","Conflict resolution","Nix tooling"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:15:51.417Z","filesModified":[],"keyDecisions":["Skipped commit f13eaa6 to resolve the rebase conflict caused by an immutable custom hook."],"narrative":"The session focused on resolving a stalled rebase caused by a conflicting pre-commit hook in a tooling-related commit. The problematic commit was identified and skipped to successfully complete the rebase process. Verification confirmed that the working tree is clean and the branch is properly rebased.","observationCount":13,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c841b99ffe9qmfTw52X9UER9","title":"Resolve Git Rebase Conflict and Finalize Branch"},"ses_13c81502dffeNCBzq0YGPKcRI6":{"concepts":["PlanEntitlements","Billing Enforcement","MCP Gateway","Service Account Limits","In-band Error Reporting"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:23:26.978Z","filesModified":["internal/billing/entitlements/entitlements.go","internal/billing/enforcer/gates.go","internal/billing/enforcer/errors.go","internal/admin/service_accounts.go","internal/admin/service_account_links.go","internal/gateway/manager.go","internal/boot/mcpmount/mcpmount.go","internal/boot/servegateway/servegateway.go","internal/boot/serveall/serveall.go","internal/billing/enforcer/enforcer_test.go","docs/billing-plans.md","docs/phases/phase-13d-plan-enforcement.md"],"keyDecisions":["Introduced separate error handling for SA connection limits: `ErrFeatureLocked` for hard RPC failures and `ErrSAConnectionLimit` for soft in-band MCP gateway errors.","Added `MaxServiceAccounts` field to `PlanEntitlements` to decouple service account limits from `MaxActiveUsers`."],"narrative":"Implemented critical billing enforcement fixes for Phase 13d, including adding `MaxServiceAccounts` to the `PlanEntitlements` struct and correcting logic in `CreateServiceAccount` to use the appropriate gate. Refactored service account connection enforcement to distinguish between hard blocking (admin RPCs returning `PermissionDenied`) and soft in-band MCP error reporting (via `CallTool`). Updated boot-time wiring for `mcpmount` to support the new billing metrics and verified all changes with `go build` and local tests.","observationCount":72,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c81502dffeNCBzq0YGPKcRI6","title":"Phase 13d Billing Enforcement Fixups"},"ses_13c7c627effe6t17IdfU9e6SIl":{"concepts":["Go build","Go vet","Unit testing","Project health check"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:24:22.615Z","filesModified":[],"keyDecisions":["Validated project integrity by running suite-wide go build, go vet, and targeted go test commands."],"narrative":"Performed a comprehensive health assessment of the project by executing build and verification commands across all Go packages. Verified that the codebase compiles successfully and runs existing unit tests across the billing, admin, gateway, boot, and transport internal modules. Confirmed overall project stability with no build failures or vet errors identified.","observationCount":17,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c7c627effe6t17IdfU9e6SIl","title":"Repository Health Check and Build Verification"},"ses_13c7bd274ffeh1qGxtPA3taJsn":{"concepts":["billing-enforcement","git-rebasing","service-account-management","stripe-integration"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:24:55.879Z","filesModified":["docs/billing-plans.md","docs/phases/phase-13d-plan-enforcement.md","internal/admin/service_account_links.go","internal/admin/service_accounts.go","internal/billing/enforcer/enforcer_test.go"],"keyDecisions":["Validated the WIP state for Phase 13d plan enforcement prior to rebasing."],"narrative":"Performed a status check on the current repository state to evaluate the progress of Phase 13d plan enforcement. Reviewed git history and file changes to identify the scope of the current work-in-progress commit. Confirmed the integration status of billing plans and the implementation of administrative service account adjustments.","observationCount":12,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c7bd274ffeh1qGxtPA3taJsn","title":"Assessment of Phase 13d Billing Enforcement WIP"},"ses_13c7b0e37ffe2lWY1jPi29M3AD":{"concepts":["Plan Enforcement","Stripe Integration","Subscription Entitlements","BillingInterceptor","Valkey"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:27:24.666Z","filesModified":["docs/billing-plans.md","docs/phases/phase-13d-plan-enforcement.md","internal/admin/service_account_links.go","internal/admin/service_accounts.go","internal/billing/enforcer/enforcer_test.go","internal/billing/entitlements/entitlements.go","internal/boot/mcpmount/mcpmount.go","internal/gateway/manager.go"],"keyDecisions":["Amended the WIP commit to consolidate all Phase 13d work into a single atomic feature commit.","Renamed the local branch to `feat/entitlement` to align with organizational naming conventions.","Set the new remote tracking branch `origin/feat/entitlement` to ensure proper CI/CD and PR integration."],"narrative":"Successfully finalized the Phase 13d billing plan enforcement implementation by amending the existing WIP commit with the latest changes and addressing pre-commit formatting fixes. The branch was renamed from `gentle-lemur` to `feat/entitlement` to better reflect the feature scope. The work was finalized by pushing the updated branch to a new upstream tracking reference on the remote repository.","observationCount":46,"project":"/home/balor/repos/obsidian-headless","sessionId":"ses_13c7b0e37ffe2lWY1jPi29M3AD","title":"Complete Phase 13d Plan Enforcement and Branch Refactoring"},"ses_17f1d7012ffewgxHR3yYWZ7WUu":{"concepts":["Git rebase","Billing enforcement","Entitlement systems","Rate limiting","Service account management"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T00:27:49.930Z","filesModified":["internal/billing/entitlements/entitlements.go","internal/admin/service_accounts.go","scripts/stripe-bootstrap/go.mod"],"keyDecisions":["Migrated service account limits to a dedicated MaxServiceAccounts field instead of overloading MaxActiveUsers.","Configured SA connection limits as a soft in-band MCP tool error rather than a hard blocking operation.","Renamed working branch to feat/entitlement for cleaner feature tracking."],"narrative":"The session focused on rebasing the Phase 13d work onto the main branch and resolving associated dependency and tooling conflicts. Following the successful rebase, the billing plan enforcement logic was updated to correctly separate service account limits from active user limits and implement soft error handling for connection rate limiting. The final implementation was validated through tests and pushed to a new feature branch.","observationCount":61,"project":"/home/balor/.local/share/opencode/worktree/7a0bcf46d20414a8f821bcf5cc3a8ef85c458fed/gentle-lemur","sessionId":"ses_17f1d7012ffewgxHR3yYWZ7WUu","title":"Rebase and Phase 13d Billing Enforcement Completion"},"ses_13c097a92ffe702BJe2M56nYx1":{"concepts":["WinForms Resource Management","ImageMagick ICO generation","Localization","SVG Color Filtering"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T02:54:14.297Z","filesModified":["SoundSwitch/Resources/Monochrome Icon.ico","img/Logo and Icon/Main-Logo-Monochrome.svg","SoundSwitch/Framework/TrayIcon/IconChanger/IconChanger.cs","SoundSwitch/Properties/Resources.resx","README.md","README.de.md"],"keyDecisions":["Generated custom ICO frames using Python PIL and combined them using ImageMagick to ensure full size compatibility (16x16 through 256x256).","Extended the IconChanger enum with a MonochromeIcon member instead of duplicating the factory logic.","Modified existing SVG source code to manually replace fill colors for a monochrome aesthetic."],"narrative":"Successfully implemented a new \"Monochrome Icon\" feature for SoundSwitch. Generated a multi-resolution ICO file from the existing logo, created a corresponding monochrome SVG, and integrated these assets into the application's resource system. Updated the C# codebase to include the new enum value, localized the UI string, and registered the new icon changer implementation. Also fixed broken image paths in the project README files.","observationCount":110,"project":"/","sessionId":"ses_13c097a92ffe702BJe2M56nYx1","title":"Add Monochrome Icon Option to SoundSwitch"},"ses_13bfeed13fferNWJFoBsj7REOl":{"concepts":["TrayIcon","IconChanger","Resource Management","Localization"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T02:42:36.820Z","filesModified":["SoundSwitch/UI/Component/TrayIcon.cs","SoundSwitch/UI/Forms/Settings.cs","SoundSwitch/Properties/Resources.resx","SoundSwitch/Localization/TrayIconStrings.resx"],"keyDecisions":["Determined that the new monochrome icon should be integrated via the existing IconChanger factory pattern to maintain consistency with current tray icon management."],"narrative":"Explored the SoundSwitch codebase to prepare for adding a \"Monochrome Icon\" option. Mapped the existing icon management framework, including the `TrayIcon` component, resource files, and configuration handling. Confirmed the structure of the `IconChanger` factory and identified necessary locations for configuration updates and localization strings.","observationCount":53,"project":"/","sessionId":"ses_13bfeed13fferNWJFoBsj7REOl","title":"Investigated Implementation Requirements for Monochrome Icon Option"},"ses_13bf6a536ffeh8FusWfvM3u0in":{"concepts":["documentation maintenance","relative file paths","README"],"createdAt":"2026-06-14T02:50:24.721Z","filesModified":["README.md","README.de.md"],"keyDecisions":["Converted absolute URLs to relative repository paths to ensure image links remain functional regardless of hosting changes."],"narrative":"Fixed broken image references in the primary and German README files for the SoundSwitch repository. Updated the hardcoded external URLs to use correct repo-relative paths for both the main project logo and the preview GIF. Verified the changes by inspecting the updated file contents.","observationCount":18,"project":"/","sessionId":"ses_13bf6a536ffeh8FusWfvM3u0in","title":"Fix broken image links in README documentation"},"ses_13bf6b380ffenBdQhYTb0jkgAM":{"concep